#: ../../src/dialogs/ConfigDialogue.cpp:448
msgid ""
"\"MathML (rendered by the browser)\" is the recommended choice: every "
"current browser renders MathML natively and instantly, and the exported page "
"needs no JavaScript and makes no requests to any external server.\n"
"\"MathML + MathJaX fall-back for old browsers\" behaves the same on current "
"browsers, but additionally downloads MathJaX from an external server (a CDN) "
"as a fall-back on browsers too old to support MathML. Only choose this if "
"you need to support such browsers and accept the external dependency.\n"
"Bitmaps tend to need more band width than the other options. They lack "
"support for advanced features like drag-and-drop or accessibility. Also they "
"have problems aligning and scaling with the rest of the text and might use "
"fonts that don't match the rest of the document."
msgstr ""

